<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<TimeML xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="TimeML_1.2.1.xsd">
  <DOCID>manuela</DOCID>
  <TIMEX3 tid="t0" type="DATE" value="2020-12-31T00:00:00" functionInDocument="CREATION_TIME" temporalFunction="false">2020-12-31</TIMEX3>
  <TEXT>Il signor Ugo di anni 63 <EVENT eid="e1" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">sposato</EVENT> con due figli, viene <EVENT eid="e2" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">ricoverato</EVENT> nell'UO di Medicina per <EVENT eid="e3" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">accertamenti</EVENT>. Al ricovero il signor Ugo presenta <EVENT eid="e4" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">forti</EVENT> dolori addominali e <EVENT eid="e5" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">vomito</EVENT>. Gli viene <EVENT eid="e6" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">posizionato</EVENT> un sondino naso gastrico. Dopo vari <EVENT eid="e7" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">accertamenti</EVENT> viene <EVENT eid="e8" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">diagnosticato</EVENT> un <EVENT eid="e9" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">K</EVENT> gastrico con metastasi del fegato e del pancreas. Il signor Ugo viene sottoposto ad <EVENT eid="e10" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">intervento</EVENT> chirurgico palliativo. Al <EVENT eid="e11" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">ritorno</EVENT> dalla sala operatoria, Ugo presenta <EVENT eid="e12" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">forti</EVENT> dolori addominali e gli è stato <EVENT eid="e13" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">posizionato</EVENT> un catetere venoso centrale e <EVENT eid="e14" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">prescritta</EVENT> una <EVENT eid="e15" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">nutrizione</EVENT> parenterale totale. <TIMEX3 tid="t1" type="DATE" value="2020-12-31" temporalFunction="false">Il giorno successivo</TIMEX3> Il signore <EVENT eid="e16" class="REPORTING" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">chiede</EVENT> quando potrà <EVENT eid="e17" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">alimentarsi</EVENT> naturalmente e quando potrà <EVENT eid="e18" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">togliere</EVENT> il catetere venoso.&#13;
</TEXT>
